  - "qualitative analysis"
  - "research codebook"
  - "large language models"
  - "multi-LLM cross-validation"
  - "psychedelic-assisted therapy"
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "EA 12FEP Codebook for LLM-Assisted Qualitative Analysis"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Nelson-Zutter"
        given-names: "Graham"
        orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-9567-6512"
    year: 2026
    doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20481464"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/aestra-research/12fep-codebook"
    notes: >-
      Methodological successor to this 4FM codebook. Built shortly after (Oct
      31 – Nov 30, 2025) and refines the build protocol: a tighter
      parallel-start + cross-LLM merge + LLM jury vote sequence (vs the per-LLM
      iteration + single-LLM self-merge + multi-LLM cross-merge + researcher
      selection used here). Reduces the source set to two primary Längle
      papers (2002, 2011b) from the four used in this codebook (1992, 2002,
      2003, 2011). Decomposes the four Fundamental Motivations into 12
      Existential Prerequisites for finer-grained scoring.
